  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "She made a grave error in attacking you so flagrantly. I now know she wants the Akashic Records and where she must go to obtain them.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-PRIM_076.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756054,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This narrows the potentialities considerably and I can strategize to cut them off. Rescuing the Shellion leader is but my first move.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-PRIM_077.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756054,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "She was taken to the shrine at highest point of the islands. That is where you must go next. But entry is only possible if a sufficient offering is made.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-PRIM_078.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756054,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The creatures within value birds, and so live birds you must offer them. The common Albatross and Whalebirds native to these islands are optimal starts.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-PRIM_079.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756054,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But you will require a rarer specimen hidden away in the ruins nearby.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-PRIM_080.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756054,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Birds here ain't exactly small. How are we supposed to capture and contain three of them?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Tarrak_Hadfield_AH-PRIM_046.mp3",
